sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Store as State Store
    participant Extractor as Extractor or LLM
    participant Policy as Action Policy
    participant Tool as Business Tool

    U->>API: user message
    API->>Store: load(session_id)
    Store-->>API: ConversationState
    API->>Extractor: extract intent and slots
    Extractor-->>API: structured extraction
    API->>API: update state
    API->>Policy: evaluate missing fields
    alt missing fields
        Policy-->>API: ask next question
        API->>Store: save(updated state)
        API-->>U: targeted question
    else ready for action
        Policy-->>API: action allowed
        API->>Tool: call with validated slots
        Tool-->>API: tool result
        API->>Store: save(completed state)
        API-->>U: confirmation
    end
